{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Concrete Spaces is an interactive poetry collection,\u00a0that plays with creating and destroying spatial expectations, spoken word inspired pacing, and bilinguality.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactive audiovisual poems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implied, yet completely unforced linearity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly written in English, with some Finnish texts in the mix. (can be fully experienced without understanding the language)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough taking 20-40 minutes, depending on your pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionless; windowed mode and keyboard input only.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These alt-games, art games, kill-gameplay-games, or whatever you'd like to call them, aren't exactly made to act as time-sinks \u2501 so if you're looking for that sort of stuff, this might not be for you... As this game was solo developed, there's still a possibility for bugs, if encountered, reload the currently open Space! Thanks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Concrete and the Sea.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3580760/6da7e0ed8194f7efe477c809e131d80533914dea.jpg"},{"name":"Naapurit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3580760/17ff63636cf14f7931506af0d069dbabaec04704.jpg"},{"name":"Scraper.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3580760/a88ec61b82ee5663f55c58e185bc1eb558de6dc3.jpg"},{"name":"Punainen lanka?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3580760/2b02e3356cdbfa948fe479ed744c0941f9629350.jpg"},{"name":"The ultimate tool?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima